{"created": "2026-05-09T15:23:25.000971+00:00", "modified": "2026-05-09T15:23:25.281717+00:00", "id": 20098065, "conceptrecid": "20098064", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.20098065", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.20098064", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20098065", "metadata": {"title": "Kiky-41/jamali-power-system-dataset: Jamali Power System Dataset v1.0.0", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.20098065", "publication_date": "2026-05-09", "description": "<h1>\u26a1 Jamali Power System Dataset v1.0.0</h1>\n<p>Initial public release of an operational and generation dataset for the Java\u2013Madura\u2013Bali (Jamali) interconnected power system.</p>\n\n\n<h2>\ud83d\udcca Overview</h2>\n<p>This repository provides benchmark operational data for large-scale power system analysis and optimization studies on the Jamali interconnected grid.</p>\n<p>The dataset is intended for studies involving:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Economic Dispatch (ED)</li>\n<li>Economic Emission Dispatch (EED)</li>\n<li>Unit Commitment (UC)</li>\n<li>Generation scheduling</li>\n<li>Power system optimization</li>\n<li>Machine learning applications in energy systems</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<h2>\ud83d\udce6 Contents</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Generator operational data</li>\n<li>Power plant characteristics</li>\n<li>Capacity information</li>\n<li>Fuel and emission parameters</li>\n<li>Benchmark test cases</li>\n<li>Supporting documentation</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<h2>\u2699\ufe0f Potential Applications</h2>\n<p>The dataset can be used for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Classical optimization methods</li>\n<li>Metaheuristic algorithms</li>\n<li>Swarm intelligence</li>\n<li>Evolutionary computation</li>\n<li>Economic and environmental dispatch</li>\n<li>Generation scheduling studies</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<h2>\ud83d\udd0d Supported Constraints</h2>\n<p>Benchmark cases may include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Generator capacity limits</li>\n<li>Ramp-rate constraints</li>\n<li>Power balance constraints</li>\n<li>Spinning reserve constraints</li>\n<li>Emission constraints</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<h2>\ud83c\udf10 System Coverage</h2>\n<p>The dataset represents the interconnected power system of:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Java</li>\n<li>Madura</li>\n<li>Bali</li>\n</ul>\n<p>which forms the largest electricity network in Indonesia.</p>\n\n\n<h2>\ud83d\udcdc License</h2>\n<p>Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)</p>\n\n\n<h2>\ud83d\ude80 Version</h2>\n<p><strong>v1.0.0 \u2014 Initial dataset release</strong></p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Rifki Rahman Nur Ikhsan", "affiliation": null}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/Kiky-41/jamali-power-system-dataset/tree/v1.0.0", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "v1.0.0", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/Kiky-41/jamali-power-system-dataset"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "20098064"}}]}}, "title": "Kiky-41/jamali-power-system-dataset: Jamali Power System Dataset v1.0.0", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20098065", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/20098065", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/20098065?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20098065", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20098065", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.20098065", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20098065/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20098064", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/20098064", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20098064", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.20098064", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:20098065/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:20098065/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20098065/f